# --- Lenore doc system ---
tmp/
docs/desk/
# THE STORE: all experiment bytes live under /data/ (datasets/, and per
# experiment regen/ + keep/ + out/<runid>/), wholly gitignored. Worktrees
# symlink their data/ to the main checkout's, so bytes exist once. Rebuild
# commands live in each experiment README's Data section. Git-worthy
# keepers are promoted by copy into experiments/*/notebook/.
/data/
# Worktree homes (each worktree gets one data -> main-repo symlink inside)
.claude/worktrees/
.worktrees/
# Defense in depth: run outputs never live inside experiments/ — the data
# symlink handles the join. These only match REAL directories (a stray local
# out/ or data/ dir), never the committed data symlink.
experiments/*/out/
experiments/*/data/
# Tool state inside experiments — regenerable, deleted when concluded
experiments/*/.venv/
experiments/*/vendor/
**/__pycache__/
# All repo-local generated state (embeddings index, warn-once stamps, any
# future local artifacts) lives under one dir. Losing it is always safe:
# the index rebuilds on next search, a lost stamp only re-arms a warning.
.lenore/
